  </head>
  <body class="paper-noise overflow-x-hidden">
    <header class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 z-50 border-b border-white/15 text-white">
      <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl items-center justify-between gap-6 px-5 py-4 lg:px-8">
        <a href="#itaas" aria-label="Bantayog ni José Rizal — bumalik sa itaas" class="shrink-0 rounded-sm bg-paper/95 px-3 py-2 shadow-lg shadow-black/10">
          <img src="/logo.svg" width="270" height="45" alt="Motto Stella — Bantayog ni José Rizal" class="h-9 w-auto sm:h-10" />
        </a>
        <nav aria-label="Pangunahing nabigasyon" class="hidden items-center gap-3 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] lg:flex xl:gap-5 xl:text-[11px]">
          <a class="transition hover:text-gold" href="#tungkol">Tungkol</a>
          <a class="transition hover:text-gold" href="#kuwento">Kuwento</a>
          <a class="transition hover:text-gold" href="#panahon">Panahon</a>
          <a class="transition hover:text-gold" href="#dalaw">Pagdalaw</a>
          <a class="transition hover:text-gold" href="#pasilidad">Pasilidad</a>
          <a class="transition hover:text-gold" href="#pagpunta">Pagpunta</a>
          <a class="transition hover:text-gold" href="#ruta">Ruta</a>
          <a class="transition hover:text-gold" href="#paligid">Paligid</a>
          <a class="transition hover:text-gold" href="#agham">Agham</a>
          <a class="transition hover:text-gold" href="#review">Review</a>
          <a class="transition hover:text-gold" href="#faq">FAQ</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main id="itaas">
      <section class="relative min-h-[92vh] overflow-hidden bg-ink text-white">
        <img src="/images/rizal-monument-flags.jpg" alt={`${entity.fullName} — pangunahing tanawin sa ${entity.city}, ${entity.country}, napapalibutan ng mga watawat ng Pilipinas sa ${entity.shortName}`} class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover object-[center_42%] opacity-55" fetchpriority="high" />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(7,23,36,.93)_0%,rgba(7,23,36,.74)_43%,rgba(7,23,36,.22)_78%,rgba(7,23,36,.46)_100%)]"></div>
        <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-44 bg-gradient-to-t from-ink to-transparent"></div>
        <div class="relative mx-auto flex min-h-[92vh] max-w-7xl items-end px-5 pb-16 pt-32 lg:px-8 lg:pb-20">
          <div class="max-w-3xl reveal">
            <div class="mb-7 flex items-center gap-4 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-gold">
              <span class="h-px w-12 bg-gold"></span>
              Motto Stella · Luneta, Maynila
            </div>
            <h1 class="display text-5xl font-normal leading-[.98] tracking-[-.045em] sm:text-7xl lg:text-[6.6rem]">Bantayog ni<br /><em class="font-normal text-paper">José Rizal</em><span class="mt-6 block font-sans text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.26em] text-gold sm:text-sm">(José Rizal Monument · {entity.shortName}, {entity.city})</span></h1>
            <p class="mt-7 max-w-2xl text-base leading-7 text-white/80 sm:text-lg">Isang himlayan, isang pambansang alaala, at isang “gumagabay na bituin” sa bukana ng Maynila. Kilalanin muna ang mga simbolo nito bago tumayo sa harap ng bantayog.</p>
            <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
              <a href="#dalaw" class="rounded-full bg-gold px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-ink transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-[#dab45c]">Planuhin ang pagdalaw</a>
              <a href="#mapa" class="rounded-full border border-white/35 bg-white/5 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white backdrop-blur transition hover:bg-white/12">Tingnan ang mapa</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section aria-label="Mabilis na impormasyon" class="relative z-10 -mt-1 bg-ink pb-10 text-white">
        <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl grid-cols-2 gap-px bg-white/15 px-5 sm:grid-cols-4 lg:px-8">
          <div class="bg-ink px-5 py-6"><p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-gold">Oras ng parke</p><p class="display mt-2 text-xl">5:00 AM–10:00 PM</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-white/55">araw-araw</p></div>
          <div class="bg-ink px-5 py-6"><p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-gold">Pangkalahatang pasok</p><p class="display mt-2 text-xl">Karaniwang libre</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-white/55">walang hiwalay na ticket sa monumento</p></div>
          <div class="bg-ink px-5 py-6"><p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-gold">Rating</p><p class="display mt-2 text-xl">{rating.value.toFixed(1)} / {rating.best}</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-white/55">{ratingCountLabel} review sa {rating.source}</p></div>
          <div class="bg-ink px-5 py-6"><p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-gold">Ilaan</p><p class="display mt-2 text-xl">45–90 minuto</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-white/55">para sa monumento at paligid</p></div>
        </div>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-7xl px-5 text-[10px] leading-5 text-white/50 lg:px-8">
          {reviewInlineNote} · <a href={entity.mapsShareUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="font-semibold text-gold transition hover:text-white">Tingnan ang lahat ng review sa Google Maps ↗</a>
        </p>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-7xl px-5 text-[10px] leading-5 text-white/50 lg:px-8">
          Lokasyon: {entity.streetAddress}, {entity.city} {entity.postalCode} · pinakamalapit na riles: LRT-1 United Nations Avenue (Taft Avenue) · may mga opisyal na seremonya at pagpapalit ng guwardiya sa monumento, kaya nag-iiba ang iskedyul ayon sa abiso ng NPDC.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="tungkol" class="border-b border-ink/10 py-16 sm:py-20">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5 lg:px-8">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.24em] text-rizal-red">Tungkol sa bantayog</p>
          <h2 class="display mt-4 text-4xl tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Tungkol sa {entity.fullName} ({entity.city})</h2>
          <nav aria-label="Hierarchy ng lokasyon" class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-ink-soft">
            <span class="font-semibold text-ink">{entity.fullName}</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold">›</span>
            <span>{entity.city}</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold">›</span>
            <span>{entity.region}</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="text-gold">›</span>
            <span>{entity.country}</span>
          </nav>
          <p class="mt-7 text-base leading-8 text-ink-soft">
            Maligayang pagdating sa <strong class="text-ink">{entity.fullName}</strong> ({entity.officialEnglishName}) — ang pambansang bantayog na malawak na kinikilala bilang sentro ng <strong class="text-ink">{entity.shortName}</strong>, ang Rizal Park sa pusod ng {entity.city}, {entity.region}, {entity.country}. Nakatayo ito sa {entity.streetAddress}, {entity.city} {entity.postalCode}, at nagsisilbing himlayan at pambansang alaala ni Dr. José Rizal.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-ink-soft">
            Kapag bumisita sa {entity.fullName}, madaling maabot ang mga kalapit na historical landmark at pasyalan, kabilang ang <strong class="text-ink">{entity.nearbyLandmark1}</strong> at <strong class="text-ink">{entity.nearbyLandmark2}</strong>. Libre at bukas sa publiko ang monumento at ang bakuran nito, kaya madali itong isingit sa isang heritage loop sa {entity.city}.
          </p>
          <dl class="mt-8 grid gap-px border border-ink/10 bg-ink/10 sm:grid-cols-3">
            <div class="bg-paper p-5"><dt class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-rizal-red">Lokasyon</dt><dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-soft">{entity.streetAddress}, {entity.city} {entity.postalCode}</dd></div>
            <div class="bg-paper p-5"><dt class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-rizal-red">Coordinates</dt><dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-soft">{entity.latitude}, {entity.longitude}</dd></div>
            <div class="bg-paper p-5"><dt class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-rizal-red">Bansa</dt><dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-soft">{entity.country} ({entity.countryCode})</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-7 text-ink-soft">
            <strong class="text-ink">Mga karaniwang tawag dito:</strong> {entity.fullName}, bantayog ni Rizal sa Luneta, monumento ni Rizal sa Luneta, {entity.officialEnglishName}, at Motto Stella — pare-parehong tumutukoy sa monumentong nasa {entity.parkName}.
          </p>
          <a href={entity.mapsShareUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-gold pb-1 text-sm font-bold text-ink transition hover:text-rizal-red">Tingnan ang eksaktong lokasyon sa Google Maps <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="kuwento" class="relative overflow-hidden py-20 sm:py-28">
        <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-12 px-5 lg:grid-cols-[.9fr_1.1fr] lg:items-center lg:px-8">
          <div class="starburst relative mx-auto w-full max-w-lg">
            <figure class="relative z-10 overflow-hidden rounded-t-[12rem] border border-ink/10 bg-stone shadow-2xl shadow-ink/15">
              <img src="/images/rizal-monument-front.jpg" alt={`${entity.fullName} — harapang tanawin ng granite at bronze sa ${entity.city}, ${entity.country}`} class="aspect-[4/5] w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
            </figure>
            <div class="absolute -bottom-5 -right-3 z-20 w-44 border border-gold/50 bg-paper p-4 shadow-xl sm:-right-8">
              <p class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.22em] text-rizal-red">Taas</p>
              <p class="display mt-1 text-3xl">14 metro</p>
              <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-5 text-ink-soft">granite at bronze, ayon sa NPDC</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="lg:pl-8">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.24em] text-rizal-red">Kasaysayan at kahalagahan ng {entity.fullName}</p>
            <h2 class="display mt-4 text-4xl leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Kasaysayan at kahalagahan ng Bantayog ni José Rizal: dinisenyo upang maging <em>gumagabay na bituin.</em></h2>
            <p class="mt-6 text-base leading-8 text-ink-soft">Ang monumento ay likha ng Swiss sculptor na si Dr. Richard Kissling. Tinawag itong <strong class="text-ink">Motto Stella</strong> — “guiding star.” Sa ilalim nito nakahimlay ang mga labi ni Dr. José Rizal, na inilipat sa Luneta bilang bahagi ng paglikha ng pambansang alaala sa lugar ng kanyang pagkamatay.</p>
            <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-ink-soft">Noong 1901, iniatas ng Act No. 243 ang pagtatayo ng bantayog. Isang pandaigdigang kumpetisyon sa disenyo ang sumunod; kalaunan, ang disenyo ni Kissling ang naisakatuparan. Ang monumento ay pormal na inilantad noong 1913.</p>
            <a href="https://npdc.gov.ph/rizal-monument/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-gold pb-1 text-sm font-bold text-ink transition hover:text-rizal-red">Basahin ang opisyal na kasaysayan sa NPDC <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="kronolohiya" class="border-b border-ink/10 py-20 sm:py-24">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 lg:px-8">
          <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[.75fr_1.25fr] lg:items-start">
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.24em] text-rizal-red">Kronolohiya at kuwento</p>
              <h2 class="display mt-4 text-4xl tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Paano nabuo ang {entity.fullName}.</h2>
              <p class="mt-5 max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-ink-soft">Mula sa batas ng 1901 hanggang sa pagbubunyag noong 1913 at sa mga sumunod na dekada — narito ang mga pangunahing hakbang sa pagkakaroon ng pambansang bantayog sa Luneta.</p>
              <p class="mt-5 max-w-md text-xs leading-6 text-ink-soft">Para sa mga tiyak na petsa at detalye ng konserbasyon, sundin ang mga opisyal na sanggunian ng NPDC at NHCP na nakalista sa seksyong mga pinagmulan.</p>
            </div>
            <ol class="border-l border-gold/60">
              {timeline.map((item) => (
                <li class="relative pb-8 pl-7">
                  <span class="absolute -left-[7px] top-2 h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-gold"></span>
                  <p class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-rizal-red">{item.year}</p>
                  <h3 class="display mt-1 text-2xl">{item.title}</h3>
                  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-soft">{item.text}</p>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ol>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-14 grid gap-px border border-ink/10 bg-ink/10 md:grid-cols-3">
            {storyNotes.map((note) => (
              <article class="bg-paper p-7">
