            <article class="border-t-2 border-gold bg-paper p-6"><span class="display text-4xl text-gold">II</span><h3 class="display mt-8 text-2xl">Ang obelisk</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-ink-soft">Ang pataas na anyo ng granite obelisk ang nagbibigay sa bantayog ng matatag at halos beacon-like na silweta sa Luneta.</p></article>
