                  <a href="https://www.pagasa.dost.gov.ph/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-gold pb-1 text-xs font-bold text-gold transition hover:text-white">Opisyal na abiso ng PAGASA <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
